{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b7c8d9e0-f1a2-3456-bcde-789012345678",
    "name": "User_portals",
    "description": "# User_portals API\n\nEndpoints for company patient-portal users (`user_portal`).\n\n## Auth\n- Header: `API-KEY` (required for create/update/change_password and bulk endpoints via `_api_validation`)\n- Body: `token`, `requester` (admin user) on authenticated endpoints\n- `login` / `reset_password` do not call `_api_validation`\n\n## Fields\n| Field | Type | Notes |\n|-------|------|-------|\n| `company_id` | number | Company FK |\n| `username` | string | Portal login |\n| `password` | string | Hashed server-side with bcrypt |\n| `user_portal_id` | number | Used on single update / change_password |\n\n## Bulk sync (`update_multiple`)\nScoped by top-level `company_id`:\n- item with `id` → update (`is_deleted = 0`)\n- item without `id` → insert (`is_deleted = 0`)\n- existing company portals whose `id` is omitted → soft-deleted (`is_deleted = 1`)\n\n## Methods\n`login`, `reset_password`, `create`, `create_multiple`, `update`, `update_multiple`, `change_password`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost/cpci-business-ops-api/public"
    },
    {
      "key": "api_key",
      "value": "{{api_key}}"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "{{token}}"
    },
    {
      "key": "requester",
      "value": "1"
    }
  ],
