          "path": [
            "user_portals",
            "reset_password"
          ]
        },
        "description": "## POST `/user_portals/reset_password`\n\nResets a portal user's password. Does not call `_api_validation`.\n\n### Required\n- `requester` — user_portal `id`\n- `new_password`\n- `is_first_login` — typically `0` after first reset\n\n### Success\n```json\n{\n  \"message\": \"Password reset successful.\",\n  \"user_id\": 5\n}\n```"
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "Success",
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "header": [
            {
              "key": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
